# rm001, the fishmonger's crust (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of rm_dagny_slaghand, ported. Name-free; her stall is in the
# Rag Market now (the table said the Heights Market's bread stall).
mantle rm001
state ready
dialect plain
accent broad light
tier standard
written_for rm_dagny_slaghand
title the fishmonger's crust
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant
traits temper=short talk=quiet warmth=reserved humour=dry
quirk carries_a_wet_stone_whetting_knife_everywhere
likes smoked_eel
dislikes hurry
fears slipping_back
hopes a_stall_of_her_own
topics prices +.3 work +.2
styles tease=dry refuse=short
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# sells fish in the Rag Market: quiet, short-tempered and dry, wasting neither words nor coin; she keeps a wet-stone whetting knife about her always.

words
saying! = Good fish tells no lies | A sharp knife wastes no meat
oath! = By salt and frost | Gut and scale
greet[here.time=dawn] = Morning to you | Here you are
greet = Here you are | Well, then
farewell = Keep your paws warm | Go well, and mind your supper
agree = Aye, that's sound | You speak true

rule @stall
when concept=bark working=yes self.role=merchant
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Fresh off the boats, and gutted while you watch. | Fish for the Commons, priced for wolves who know a catch.

rule @knife
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The knife stays by the door. A fishmonger keeps her tools close. | Set the coin aside. Tomorrow's catch won't pay for itself.

scene remark
when concept=talk.smalltalk
does give.opinion / agree
a : A street is fed by steady paws, not grand promises. #saying#.
b[old] : I've seen enough grand promises to know.
b : That's the truth of it.

line greet.return : #greet#. Quick, now; the ice is melting.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Who'd have thought it?
line react.news.known : I heard. Gutting fish, you hear everything.
line answer.how : Can't complain. Wouldn't help if I did.
line preclose [self.working=yes] : Well. These won't gut themselves.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. You've found me before the good ones go.
dlg shop.greet : #greet#. Fish, fresh this morning. Pick, or step aside.
